# cuccaro_add2 — 2-bit Cuccaro ripple-carry 가산기 (HE3 H3.1 산술 1급 자산화, 8/8 만장일치 축).
# wires(big-endian, w0=MSB): 0=a1 1=a0 2=b1 3=b0 4=cin 5=z. 의미: |a,b,cin,z⟩ → |a,(a+b+cin) mod 4,cin,z⊕carry⟩.
# MAJ/UMA 사다리(quant-ph/0410184): {cnot,toffoli}만 — 신규 module 0, 회전각 0(순수 가역 고전산술).
# golden=정수산술 순열(회로 독립: a+b+cin 정수 덧셈에서 직접 유도). a·cin 복원(가역성).
```json id=app_meta
{"id": "cuccaro_add2", "n_sys": 6, "n_anc": 0}
```
```python id=app_golden
import numpy as np
n = 6; dim = 2 ** n
A, B, CIN, Z = [1, 0], [3, 2], 4, 5      # a/b: [LSB, MSB] wire index
golden = np.zeros((dim, dim), dtype=complex)
for basis in range(dim):
    bits = [(basis >> (n - 1 - q)) & 1 for q in range(n)]
    s = sum(bits[A[i]] << i for i in range(2)) + sum(bits[B[i]] << i for i in range(2)) + bits[CIN]
    out = list(bits)
    for i in range(2):
        out[B[i]] = (s >> i) & 1
    out[Z] ^= (s >> 2) & 1
    golden[int("".join(map(str, out)), 2), basis] = 1
```
